tools: add idf_build.py, a Git Bash-safe idf.py wrapper

Encodes the two traps that made 'idf.py build' a silent no-op under Git
Bash, so the next person does not have to rediscover them:

  - idf.py skips main() when MSYSTEM is set, and Git Bash always sets it
  - a ';'-separated PATH is mangled by MSYS path conversion

Settings come from idf_env.bat rather than being hard-coded, so the
wrapper tracks the toolchain if the installation changes.

    python tools/idf_build.py build
    python tools/idf_build.py -p COM5 flash
